            <note corresp="#d81-f2" n="2" xml:id="d81-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it approved action proposed in HNC 1118, part 1 and informed CINCUNC
                    that the decision on part 2 was being sent by a separate message, JCS 905427 to
